ANSIBLE CONFIGURATION PATTERN:
For New VM/LXC (Before Domain Join):
1. Deploy from template
VM: From golden image
LXC: From Rocky LXC template (online)
2. Temporary SSH access
bash# On Ansible LXC, run script:
./copy-ansible-key.sh  # Copies SSH key to new VM/LXC
3. Ansible playbook - Common tools
yaml# playbooks/common-tools.yml
- Install: vim, htop, curl, git, net-tools, traceroute
4. Ansible playbook - Join IPA domain
yaml# playbooks/ipa-join.yml
- Run: ipa-client-install
5. Ansible playbook - Cleanup SSH key
yaml# playbooks/cleanup-ssh.yml  
- Remove: Ansible SSH key from authorized_keys
After Domain Join:
6. Ansible playbook - Service-specific
yaml# playbooks/nginx-service.yml
- Install: nginx, certbot, etc
- Configure: nginx.conf
Now uses: ansible_bot + Kerberos (no SSH key needed)

